8 U-02 IN DEPTH (the dependency round of 2 October 2026: the owner's question on the 2.159 W/K line, its configuration, the
  fans' power, T-H1, and what a failed reading changes)
8a THE BASIS OF THE LINES. Each line is the heat into the sealed case divided by the room between the ambient and the limit of
   the parts the air must hold, G = Q / (T_limit - T_ambient) (the mixed air at the limit, 0 K of margin):
   E5, the hold           Q 21.587 W (19.497 W + the ballasts 2.09 W) / (70 - 60) K = 2.159 W/K; dG/dQ 0.1000 W/K per W, dG/dT_limit -0.2159 W/K per K
                          +-1 W: 2.059 to 2.259 W/K; the limit +-1 K (or the ambient -+1 K): 1.962 to 2.399 W/K
   E3-O, the heat stage   Q 27.086 W (24.996 W + the ballasts 2.09 W) / (70 - 55) K = 1.806 W/K; dG/dQ 0.0667 W/K per W, dG/dT_limit -0.1204 W/K per K
                          +-1 W: 1.739 to 1.872 W/K; the limit +-1 K (or the ambient -+1 K): 1.693 to 1.935 W/K
   E5, no hold            Q 27.086 W (24.996 W + the ballasts 2.09 W) / (70 - 60) K = 2.709 W/K; dG/dQ 0.1000 W/K per W, dG/dT_limit -0.2709 W/K per K
                          +-1 W: 2.609 to 2.809 W/K; the limit +-1 K (or the ambient -+1 K): 2.462 to 3.010 W/K
   E5's heat under the hold, built up (MODELED, pwr_budget.py and pwr_red2.py as reproduced in 0, plan): 14.671 W at the load
   pins, 3.445 W lost in the converters, 0.036 W in the distribution (fuses, FETs, shunt, leads): 18.152 W at the pack; on shore
   the front end's and the charger's loss on it adds 1.345 W: 19.497 W into the case; L4-E8's ballasts add 2.09 W at the bound's
   worst corner (MODELED by L4-E8, ripple_dense.out, read): 21.587 W. The ambient 60 C is E5's dwell (Table 507.6-IX, 30 to 60
   C, the dwell from 0200 to 0800, 6 h, transcribed in mil-std-810h-method-507-6.md). The limit +70 C is the class the hold
   leaves in the air at E5 (each at its limit by 1j):
      RB9704 off +70 C (operating); LIME off +70 C (storage); SA868 off +70 C (operating); PCM2912A off +70 C (recommended); G6K off +70 C (operating); SGP41 off +50 C (recommended (Table 4)); H5007NL on +70 C (operating); ATP16 on +70 C (operating); PXP4043C off +70 C (operating)
   The loads the hold changes, heat stage -> hold at the load pins (W): CM5 slot 3 4.500 -> 2.000, VHF PA 30 W 0.900 -> 0.000,
   board D (SA868 and logic) 0.600 -> 0.000, LoRa E22-900M30S 0.300 -> 0.000, Geiger module 0.300 -> 0.000, RockBLOCK 9704 0.060
   -> 0.000, E72 x2 (Zigbee, Thread) 0.048 -> 0.000; into the case 24.996 -> 19.497 W. The loads of E5's hold, largest first (W
   at the load pins / at the pack): CM5 slot 3 2.000 / 2.224; panel board C 1.500 / 1.617; KSZ9897R AVDDL+DVDDL 1.2 V 1.452 /
   1.841; two mixer fans 1.440 / 1.443; other +3V3_DEV logic 1.300 / 1.528; three STM32H743 supervisors and their parts 1.297 /
   2.160; NVMe slot 3 0.900 / 1.165; KSZ9897R AVDDH 2.5 V 0.825 / 1.280; cooler fan slot 3 0.510 / 0.567; three TUSB8041 hubs
   VDD33 0.510 / 0.599; board A logic 0.500 / 0.569; board E controller and sensors 0.500 / 0.834; four CP2102N bridges 0.400 /
   0.431; PCIe switch 3.3 V slot 3 0.355 / 0.459; LG290P GNSS 0.327 / 0.384; PCIe switch 1.0 V slot 3 0.270 / 0.353; KSZ9897R
   VDDIO 3.3 V 0.264 / 0.310; three TUSB8041 hubs VDD 1.1 V 0.221 / 0.280; QMX USB and HDMI 5 V 0.100 / 0.108.
   E3-O's 1.806 W/K: the heat stage's 24.996 W into the case with every radio C1 leaves on, plus the ballasts, over E5's same
   +70 C limit from E3-O's +55 C (TEST-PLAN E3-O); it equals LO-01a's floor with the ballasts (1.8058 W/K) only because both
   rooms are 15 K. The 2.709 W/K: the heat stage's heat in E5 with no hold. Classes: the heat MODELED (the model's figures carry
   their own tiers: S sheet, R representative, D declared, T placeholder); the ballasts MODELED by L4-E8; the ambient and the
   limit MAKER and TEST-PLAN as read; the line itself MODELED, and CONDITIONAL as a requirement on T-H1.
8b THE CONFIGURATION IT ASSUMES. Lid open, deployed, on shore (TEST-PLAN E3-O and E5); every conductance here is W4's lid-open
   fans-on value or a T-H1 reading in that state. The fans of 32.53 item 2 (REQ-043): three cooler fans, one per CM5 cooler on
   its slot's fan header, and two mixer fans under the plate on board E's sensor controller, their speed set from the inside
   climate reading. In both margins three run: two mixer fans 1.44, cooler fan slot 3 0.51 (W at the load pins; slots 1 and 2
   and their coolers are off in the heat stage and the hold). D-18 is OPEN: no fan is picked. The model carries representatives
   (Sunon, catalogue extract p.1 and p.2): the cooler fan MF30060V2, 30 mm, 0.36 W, 3.7 CFM (MF30060V1 0.56 W, 4.9 CFM), not
   IP68; the mixers GF60151B9 to B6, "60x60x15 mm (IP68)", 0.39 to 1.50 W, 10.6 to 21.3 CFM. No held sheet gives a fan's
   operating temperature: REQ-043's acceptance asks for "a published operating range covering -20 C to the inside-air bar
   part_temps.py computes from pcb_envelope.yaml", and the fans are 7c's ARCHITECTURE line. T-H1's hardware list names Same
   Sky's CFM-6025BG68 for the mixers (READY-TO-ACT.md 5.2).
   The heat path under the no-vent ruling (32.53 item 1): the 3 mm aluminium plate (0.0912 m2) and the PP walls (0.1373 to
   0.2200 m2) and floor (0.0961 to 0.1352 m2) only. W4's split, lid open with the fans (W/K, the walls and floor together / the
   plate): low case 0.778 / 0.444, high case 2.131 / 0.718; lid closed 0.778 / 0.282 and 2.131 / 0.362. The mixers stir the air
   under the plate across the boards and onto the plate and the walls: the inside film W4 takes as 10 to 25 W/m2K with them and
   4 to 6 W/m2K without. The hold's reference: today board B's TMP117 under the coolers, on the kit bus through the panel
   controller (CONOPS 4c), a board sensor in the coolers' air; 4d requires it in the mixed air by the +70 C parts or calibrated
   to +-0.899099 K.
   If the fans stop (W4 lid open, fans off: 0.77 to 1.57 W/K; 32.53 says about 2.1 W/K still): the hold's heat less the fans'
   own 2.16 W (into the case) puts E5's mixed air at 72.38 to 85.36 C (it needs 1.943 W/K to stay at +70 C) and E3-O's at 70.89
   to 87.56 C: the +70 C class is past its limit on W4's still values. One mixer of two stopping lies between the two states (no
   model). Parts coupled to the plate (8e, F4) stay at the plate: with the still film's plate fraction 0.258 to 0.387, at most
   69.82 C (E5) and 67.60 C (E3-O). The cooler fan of slot 3 stopping leaves the module to its own throttling (CM5 4.4: it
   "reduces its clock speed to keep the SoC temperature below 85 C"), which E3-O's pass line allows ("CM5 throttling logged but
   no shutdown"). The controls act on the measured air whatever the cause (C1, the hold); a stopped fan is seen by its
   tachometer only where the picked fan has one.
8c THE FANS IN THE ENERGY BUDGET. They are counted, not left in the undocumented share: pwr_budget.py carries "cooler fan slot
   1..3" in every state where its slot runs and "two mixer fans" in every state, tier R (representatives, D-18 open; the mixers'
